From e0b88066e093c08154087f3bf392bd0d656fda92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dhanraj <dp914278@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:23:58 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Add configurable Backspace navigation

Restore Backspace shortcut navigation from nautilus <= 3.4 and make the
navigation action configurable.

Allow users to configure whether pressing Backspace navigates to the
parent folder (default) or returns to the previous location in history,
without requiring a restart.

Add preference schema key backspace-action, preferences dialog option
in the General section, window-slot action routing, and regression tests.
